    <briefdescription>
<para>Registry of <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_material_points_1_1_material_point" kindref="compound">Marmot::Discretizations::MaterialPoints::MaterialPoint</ref> types, created by name. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A material point module registers each of its types once, at static initialization time, with a factory function (typically a captureless lambda) in its <computeroutput>*Registration</computeroutput>.cpp: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">static</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">bool</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>isRegistered<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_registry_1_1_material_point_factory_1ae7ab20142947ce63ea5d24074d42ab69" kindref="member">Marmot::Registry::MaterialPointFactory::registerMaterialPoint</ref>(</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Displacement/PlaneStrain&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>[](<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">int</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>n,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">const</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal">*<sp/>coords,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">int</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>sizeCoords,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordtype">double</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>volume<sp/>)<sp/>-&gt;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Marmot::Discretizations::MaterialPoints::MaterialPoint*<sp/>{<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">new</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>DisplacementMaterialPoint2D(<sp/>n,<sp/>coords,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">sizeCoords,<sp/>volume<sp/>);<sp/>}<sp/>);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> Names are case-insensitive (stored in upper case). The class is not instantiable; all members are static. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
